{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05810","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷 · 梁昇卿","name":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何意重关道，千年过圣皇。\n幽林承睿泽，闲客见清光。\n日御仙途远，山灵寿域长。\n寒云入晋薄，春树隔汾香。\n国佐同时雨，天文属岁阳。\n从来汉家盛，未若此巡方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁昇卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}